  "known_gaps": [
    "field.ers-ats.respiratory-measurement: the combined criterion lists ATS/ERS standards backed by separate verified methodology rows; the primary source field points to the spirometry row, with additional source locators recorded in receipts.",
    "ro.manuscript-statements.conflict-of-interest: the legal row states physicians must identify and eliminate conflicts affecting medical decisions; it does not itself specify journal disclosure format, so this criterion is limited to checking for disclosure and remains advisory.",
    "ro.manuscript-statements.ethics: the verified row supports that CNBMDM performs ethical analysis and issues opinions; the exact committee-name, approval-number, and date format is a reviewer prompt and remains advisory.",
    "No separate verified row was available for a national-law rule requiring a general manuscript consent/anonymisation statement, so the criterion is limited to the cited research-consent and confidentiality rules.",
    "ro.manuscript-statements.eu-ct-number: omitted because ro.ctis-evaluation confirms that decisions are transmitted through CTIS but does not verify a manuscript requirement to state the EU CT number."
  ]
